# EVM private key used ONLY for paid x402 calls (EIP-3009 authorizations).
# Fund the wallet with a little USDC on Base (eip155:8453) + a little ETH for
# nothing (the client never sends an on-chain transaction; the facilitator
# settles). Keep this file out of git. Leave empty to run free-only.
X402_EVM_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Max USD per paid call. Default 0.01; the tool refuses anything above 0.05.
X402_MAX_AMOUNT_USD=0.01
